      "text": "So you just gotta keep going."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10647,
      "text": "Like when I grinded for shiny gear at Tina,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10653,
      "text": "Are you a shiny hunter too?"
    },
    {
